=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"\\u003e\\u003cimg alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"\\u003e\\u003c/picture\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\n\\n\\u003csup\\u003eTriggered by learned rule: \\u003ca href=\\\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot/rules/learned/9e04ac2e-f264-40ee-8a1e-3b5aa364edf9\\\"\\u003eCheckpoint logic must handle both v1 and v2 format modes\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/sup\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003csup\\u003eReviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).\\u003c/sup\\u003e\\n\",\"created\":\"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\"line\":null,\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go\",\"user\":\"cursor[bot]\"}\n{\"body\":\"### Cached settings loader always reports repo as set up\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n\\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\\u003e\\n`cachedTourSettingsLoader` hardcodes the `isSetUp` return value to `true` whenever `loadErr` is nil. But `settings.Load()` succeeds with default settings even when no `.entire/settings.json` exists, so in repos where Entire was never enabled, `ResolveState` skips the `StageSetup` route and falls through to `StageAgentInstall`. Users who haven't set up Entire see the \\\"install agent hooks\\\" prompt instead of the \\\"get started with Entire\\\" setup prompt.\\n\\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 53a75f77-400c-4922-bdaf-f261dc90b6eb --\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L167-L175\\nLOCATIONS END --\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003e\\u003cpicture\\u003e\\u003csource media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\